 and other market related events.</p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"><a href="/publicdocs/nyse/ICE_NYSE_2026_Yearly_Trading_Calendar.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-icon="MoveRightIcon" class="text-left no-underline hover:underline cursor-pointer print:text-black print:underline text-black hover:text-black font-bold inline [&amp;_svg]:inline">READ <span class="whitespace-nowrap">NOW<!-- --> <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.072 8.024L5.715 3.667l.618-.62L11 7.716v.618L6.333 13l-.618-.619 4.357-4.357z"></path></svg></span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pt-20 pr-6 pb-20 pl-6 lg:pb-16"><div id="integration-id-7065c00" data-testid="belt" class="mx-auto w-full sm:w-[540px] md:w-[720px] lg:w-[960px] xl:w-[1140px] 2xl:w-[1320px]"><div><div class=""><button type="button" class="inline-flex w-full items-center align-middle focus:outline-none p-2 border border-gray-400 font-bold leading-4 duration-100 bg-gray-300 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-400 active:bg-gray-500" disabled=""><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="duration-200" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.072 8.024L5.715 3.667l.618-.62L11 7.716v.618L6.333 13l-.618-.619 4.357-4.357z"></path></svg><span class="pl-2">Indices</span></button><div class="overflow-y-auto"><div data-testid="expander" aria-expanded="false" class="overflow-hidden"><div class="border-x border-gray-400 p-2"><div data-rich-text-ignore="true" class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="table-stats table-fixed"><colgroup><col class="w-1/3"/><col class="w-1/6"/><col class="w-1/6"/><col class="w-1/6"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th>Description</th><th style="text-align:right">La