"border-x border-gray-400 p-2 border-b"><div data-rich-text-ignore="true" class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="table-stats table-fixed"><colgroup><col class="w-1/3"/><col class="w-1/6"/><col class="w-1/6"/><col class="w-1/6"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th>Description</th><th style="text-align:right">Last</th><th>Change (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pt-4"><div id="integration-id-4555043" class=""><div class="text-right"><p data-type="disclaimer" class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0 text-xxs font-light leading-tight"><span class="italic">Market data delayed minimum of 15 minutes</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray pt-40 pr-6 pl-6"><div id="integration-id-9701085" data-testid="belt" class="mx-auto w-full sm:w-[540px] md:w-[720px] lg:w-[960px] xl:w-[1140px] 2xl:w-[1320px]"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row"><div style="max-width:100vw" class="flex flex-col flex-1"></div><div style="max-width:100vw" class="flex flex-col items-center flex-4"><div class="!mb-20"><img src="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/NYSE-homepage-pattern-02.svg" alt="What&#x27;s next [fade-up]" class=""/></div><div class=""><div class="text-center"><h2 class="m-0 font-headings border-0 pb-0 print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 font-medium normal-case leading-none print:break-after-avoid text-3xl imt:text-[1.75rem] md:text-5xl md:imt:text-4xl imt:mb-6"><span class="font-bold">What’s next?</span></h2><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"><br/><span class="text-[1rem] md:text-[1.25rem]">The NYSE looks forward to welcoming more leading companies from around the world in 2026, growing our one-of-a-kind community and setting the pace for innovation on a global scale. We’re endlessly inspired by the people behind these companies, check out their stories below and let’s make something happen together.</span></p></div></div></div><div style="max-width:100vw" class="flex flex-col flex-1"></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray pt-20 pr-6 pb-20 pl-6 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-40"><div id="integration-id-6a30a85" data-testid="belt" class="mx-auto w-full sm:w-[540px] md:w-[720px] lg:w-[960px] xl:w-[1140px] 2xl:w-[1320px]"><div class="flex gap-20 items-center flex-col lg:flex-row"><div style="max-width:100vw" class="flex flex-col flex-1"><div data-testid="accent" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-500 shadow-[var(--width)_var(--width)_0_0_var(--top-color)] mb-2 mr-2" style="--width:8px;--top-color:#71c5e8;--bottom-color:#c6e8f6"><img src="/publicdocs/images/NYSE_Homepage_All_in_Liquidity_Summit.jpg" alt="two people sitting down and speaking at a conference" class=""/></div></div><div style="max-width:100vw" class="flex flex-col flex-1"><div class=""><h2 class="m-0 font-headings border-0 pb-0 print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 font-medium normal-case leading-none print:break-after-avoid text-3xl imt:text-[1.75rem] md:text-5xl md:imt:text-4xl imt:mb-6"><span class="font-bold">All-in Liquidity Summit</span></h2><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"></p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"><br/><span class="text-[1rem] md:text-[1.25rem]">NYSE sponsored the All-In Liquidity Summit 2026 in Yountville, California. It included hosting a media hub where marquee speakers and attendees sat down for interviews with NYSE&#x27;s Kristen Scholer. The conversations covered AI, investing trends, and the allocation of capital.</span></p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"><a data-is-button="true" href="https://tv.nyse.com/all-in-liquidity-summit" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-checked="false" class="font-medium justify-center items-center no-underline focus-within:outline-none focus:outline-none focus-within:ring focus:ring focus:bg-gray-200 focus:text-black leading-tight align-middle duration-75 act